# Copy this file to .env.local, then fill in the values:
#
#     cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# .env.local is gitignored — it holds real values and must never be committed.
# Flowpad also writes project secrets here (Project secrets → bind a secret to
# an env var name), and it will only do so while the file stays untracked.
#
# Add one KEY=value line per secret your app needs, for example:
#
# API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
